  "title": "Open pit",
  "titles": {
    "en": "Open pit",
    "ru": "Карьер"
  },
  "description": "Queue of ore blocks dug by the excavators. Haul roads: visibility_m, road_grip (friction index 0..1), haul_speed_pct and road_restrict (traffic restriction in force) show the winter road. States: RUN, STOP.",
